[2026-09-26T10:18:09.230Z]                             exit 1
[2026-09-26T10:18:09.230Z]                         fi
[2026-09-26T10:18:09.230Z]                         echo "image_id: $image_id"
[2026-09-26T10:18:09.230Z] 
